WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,240
Linjingxu didn’t reply to my messages even after he returned home.

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:08,550
I'm at home. What are you calling? Are you okay?

3
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:10,710
My phone accidentally turned dark

4
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:15,940
Grandpa, Dad, no, Rainbow Dash

5
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,940
Let's go see what grandma is doing

6
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,980
Grandpa will take you and grandma to pick grapes tomorrow, okay?

7
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:28,050
Bian Yu is coming back

8
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:31,370
This girl didn’t tell her earlier.

9
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:37,690
I called and asked but hung up.

10
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:38,850
Probably busy again

11
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:40,210
Where did you just say it came from?

12
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,050
I caught your sweetheart Feng Changyi

13
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:46,210
Feng Changyi, this woman is a bit evil

14
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:49,650
When he saw me yesterday, Old Demon Ling nodded to me.

15
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,770
Could it be that you are having sex with that kid from the Yun family again?

16
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:57,950
They are all mixed up, right? No, there really is no Ling Lao Yao.

17
00:00:58,550 --> 00:00:59,710
You'd better not have

18
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:01,670
Mom, you are so beautiful

19
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:03,430
You look so beautiful in this outfit

20
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:08,750
Your mother, I care about my appearance

21
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:10,710
Still very confident and hot enough, right?

22
00:01:13,430 --> 00:01:14,870
Ling Buqiu, please make a little more noise

23
00:01:14,870 --> 00:01:15,870
Sleep under the bed at night
